{"id": "RT-guide-static-neurology-dopa-responsive-dystonia", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"id": "main-content", "class": "wrap"}, "c": [{"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD home"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/"}, "c": ["Guidebook"]}]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD"]}, " · Static reading view · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/#/n/drd"}, "c": ["Interactive version"]}]}, {"t": "h1", "c": ["Dopamine-responsive dystonia: a distinct clinical question"]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "small", "c": ["Status: sourced · Content checked 2026-10-06"]}]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lede"}, "c": ["Dopa-responsive dystonia is a specific group of movement disorders. Improvement with an ADHD medicine is not equivalent to the clinical levodopa response used in its assessment."]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "1"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Quick understanding"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N7", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Many presentations begin with dystonia in childhood. Symptoms may worsen later in the day and improve after sleep, although adult presentations can differ."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N7"}, "c": ["N7"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "2"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Possible explanations"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N7", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["GCH1, TH and SPR are among the genes involved. These disorders affect dopamine production; a general feeling of low energy or poor concentration does not identify them."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N7"}, "c": ["N7"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "3"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Useful next action"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Record age at onset, patterned postures, time-of-day changes and previous professionally supervised treatment responses. Ask a movement-disorder specialist whether this pattern warrants investigation."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "4"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Treatment logic"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N7", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Levodopa can substantially improve symptoms in dopa-responsive dystonia. Assessment and any treatment trial should be managed by a clinician."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N7"}, "c": ["N7"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "5"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Deeper explanation"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["The specific drug, measured outcome and persistence of response matter. Keep perceived responses to different substances separate in the record rather than calling all of them one dopamine test."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "6"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Evidence and onward routes"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Clinical information: ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N7"}, "c": ["N7"]}]}, ". These are institutional explainers; the page is sourced, not independently medically reviewed."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["For abrupt new neurological symptoms, use urgent medical assessment rather than this reading route."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Useful questions"]}, {"t": "ul", "c": [{"t": "li", "c": ["Does the clinical pattern justify considering this condition?"]}, {"t": "li", "c": ["How would any supervised trial be measured and interpreted?"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Uncertainty"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Diurnal change is not specific to this condition. This overview cannot decide whether a levodopa trial is appropriate or diagnose a pathway defect."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Sources cited"]}, {"t": "ol", "c": [{"t": "li", "a": {"id": "src-N7"}, "c": [{"t": "b", "c": ["N7"]}, " MedlinePlus Genetics — Dopa-responsive dystonia ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/condition/dopa-responsive-dystonia/"}, "c": ["link"]}, " ", {"t": "i", "c": ["(Webpage read; not an independent systematic review)"]}]}]}]}, {"t": "nav", "c": [{"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/tools/appointment-preparation/"}, "c": ["Next action: Prepare for an appointment"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/understand/pain-fatigue-movement/"}, "c": ["Related: Pain, fatigue and movement"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/evidence/open-questions/"}, "c": ["Deeper: Open research questions"]}]}]}]}}